LIBRARY LWFILE
DESCRIPTION '8086 Windows 3.0 bounded file-dialog subset'
EXETYPE WINDOWS
CODE PRELOAD MOVEABLE DISCARDABLE
DATA PRELOAD MOVEABLE SINGLE
HEAPSIZE 4096
EXPORTS
 GETOPENFILENAME @1
 GETSAVEFILENAME @2
 COMMDLGEXTENDEDERROR @26
 GETFILETITLE @27
 WEP @100 RESIDENTNAME
 FILEDLGPROC @101
 PROMPTPROC @102
